{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25474","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 花药栏 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 花药栏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蕙草春已碧，兰花秋更红。\n四时发英艳，三径满芳丛。\n秀色濯清露，鲜辉摇惠风。\n王孙未知返，幽赏竟谁同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}